  "releaseCommitReachabilityNote": "console-contract-v1.0.1 tags a branch commit that the squash merge did not place on backend main, exactly as console-contract-v1.0 did. The immutable release keeps the tag and its object alive, so default-branch reachability is deliberately not asserted and must not be added as a check.",
